          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "we should definitely do, three actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 9.69,
          "en": "We should enable this Delete button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.69,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "And when editing a recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "no matter if creating a new one or editing an existing one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "we should make the Cancel button work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "and upon hitting Save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 20.7,
          "en": "we should navigate away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 21.81,
          "en": "Actually that's the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.81,
          "end": 24.3,
          "en": "which should happen when hitting Cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.3,
          "end": 26.55,
          "en": "So that would be a challenge for you again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.55,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "Make all three buttons work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 32.07,
          "en": "Save and Cancel to simply navigate away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.07,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "and then also the Delete button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 37.083,
          "en": "to delete our recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.12,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "Here is my approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "What I want to do is, I want to start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "with the Delete button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "For this, I'll start the recipe service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 52.95,
          "en": "and add a delete recipe method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 57.72,
          "en": "recipe, where I will get the index of the recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.72,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "which should get deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "And in here I will then use my recipes array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "called the splice method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 69.06,
          "en": "and splice at the index one element to remove it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "Thereafter, I'll call recipes \"changed\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 76.68299999999999,
          "en": "and emit a copy of the updated recipes, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 79.503,
          "en": "That's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "Now I can call Delete Recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "from the Recipe Detail component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "which is where we have this Delete button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 92.66,
          "en": "by adding a click listener on Delete Recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.12,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "And here I will copy that and implement it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 97.44,
          "en": "in the TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "here on Delete Recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 101.82,
          "en": "And I simply want to reach out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 105.50999999999999,
          "en": "to the Recipe Service called Delete Recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.50999999999999,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "And now we also need the ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 110.37,
          "en": "So we used it early in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.37,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "to have this more complicated way of navigating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.43,
          "end": 116.37,
          "en": "but for deleting now we really need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.37,
          "end": 120.093,
          "en": "So here we should add this ID as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 122.37,
          "en": "So before we test this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.37,
          "end": 125.97,
          "en": "let's also make the Cancel and Save button work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.97,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "and let them navigate us away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 129.93,
          "en": "So in the Recipe Added component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "which is where we have these buttons here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 136.053,
          "en": "we should hook them up to an event listener.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 139.11,
          "en": "So Cancel we should hook up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.11,
          "end": 141.75,
          "en": "the other one already is automatically triggering",
